        "shortDesc": "An intuitive construction project management platform built to streamline blueprint tracking, site metrics, resource allocation, and team collaboration in real time.",
        "content": "<p class=\"text text-18\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">Construction Project Management Software streamlines project management by helping teams plan, schedule, and allocate resources efficiently. It centralizes communication among contractors, subcontractors, and clients, enabling easy sharing of updates, documents, and progress reports. With features like budget tracking, task management, and real-time reporting, it improves project visibility, reduces delays, and ensures projects stay on time and within budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"project-mobile-preview\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\r\n<img src=\"/img/project/Iphone view.png\" alt=\"Construction Project Management Mobile App\" class=\"mobile-mockup-img\" width=\"779\" height=\"1189\" loading=\"lazy\" />\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"project-challenge\">\r\n<h2 class=\"heading text-36\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">Key Capabilities</h2>\r\n<ul class=\"challenge-list list-unstyled\">\r\n<li class=\"challenge-item\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\r\n<svg class=\"icon-24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n<path d=\"M17.9999 6.99486L16.5899 5.58594L10.2499 11.9211L11.6599 13.33L17.9999 6.99486ZM22.2399 5.58594L11.6599 16.1578L7.47991 11.991L6.06991 13.3999L11.6599 18.9857L23.6599 6.99486L22.2399 5.58594ZM0.409912 13.3999L5.99991 18.9857L7.40991 17.5767L1.82991 11.991L0.409912 13.3999Z\" fill=\"CurrentColor\"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n<div class=\"text text-18\"><strong>User-Friendly:</strong> Select intuitive software for quick team adoption.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"challenge-item\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"50\">\r\n<svg class=\"icon-24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n<path d=\"M17.9999 6.99486L16.5899 5.58594L10.2499 11.9211L11.6599 13.33L17.9999 6.99486ZM22.2399 5.58594L11.6599 16.1578L7.47991 11.991L6.06991 13.3999L11.6599 18.9857L23.6599 6.99486L22.2399 5.58594ZM0.409912 