cts.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"challenge-item\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"150\">\r\n<svg class=\"icon-24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n<path d=\"M17.9999 6.99486L16.5899 5.58594L10.2499 11.9211L11.6599 13.33L17.9999 6.99486ZM22.2399 5.58594L11.6599 16.1578L7.47991 11.991L6.06991 13.3999L11.6599 18.9857L23.6599 6.99486L22.2399 5.58594ZM0.409912 13.3999L5.99991 18.9857L7.40991 17.5767L1.82991 11.991L0.409912 13.3999Z\" fill=\"CurrentColor\"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n<div class=\"text text-18\"><strong>Return Inventory:</strong> Handle expenses when material or inventory is returned to the supplier, ensuring accurate accounting of returned goods.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"challenge-item\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"200\">\r\n<svg class=\"icon-24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n<path d=\"M17.9999 6.99486L16.5899 5.58594L10.2499 11.9211L11.6599 13.33L17.9999 6.99486ZM22.2399 5.58594L11.6599 16.1578L7.47991 11.991L6.06991 13.3999L11.6599 18.9857L23.6599 6.99486L22.2399 5.58594ZM0.409912 13.3999L5.99991 18.9857L7.40991 17.5767L1.82991 11.991L0.409912 13.3999Z\" fill=\"CurrentColor\"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n<div class=\"text text-18\"><strong>Handle Returns:</strong> Manage expenses when material or inventory is returned to the supplier.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"challenge-item\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"250\">\r\n<svg class=\"icon-24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n<path d=\"M17.9999 6.99486L16.5899 5.58594L10.2499 11.9211L11.6599 13.33L17.9999 6.99486ZM22.2399 5.58594L11.6599 16.1578L7.47991 11.991L6.06991 13.3999L11.6599 18.9857L23.6599 6.99486L22.2399 5.58594ZM0.409912 13.3999L5.99991 18.9857L7.40991 17.5767L1.82991 11.991L0.409912 13.3999Z\" fill=\"CurrentColor\"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n<div class=\"text text-18\"><strong>Project 